WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.667
01  Open Dashboard, then find Learning activity for the selected course.

2
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:10.667
02  Review tracked tokens and responses; the calendar spans the rolling six months.

3
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.333
03  Set From and To to focus on a two-week window of course activity.

4
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:20.667
04  Group by week to compare periods without changing the selected course or dates.

5
00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:27.083
05  Switch to Assets and daily grouping to inspect when saved work was created.

6
00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:31.417
06  Small-cohort distributions stay hidden. Activity counts do not prove mastery.
